Subject: [PATCH 26/26] hip: lengthen MoE J96/J128 k-loop unroll to 8

The decode-only MoE prefill (6 of 128 experts) runs the Q4_K J96/J128 tile
after gather_and_permute_ids. Raising the k-loop unroll from the stock 4 to 8
shortens the dominant Q4_K down-projection inner loop. Arithmetic order is
unchanged; masked lanes remain padded and masked exactly.
GGML_CUDA_MMQ_MOE_NUNROLL restores the stock factor for a same-binary A/B.

